  AND THE STRATIFIED PRIMARY: adjacency counted WITHIN blocks of L windows,
  each scored against its own local rate, so a trend between blocks cannot
  contribute. Two values of L, because a conclusion that hinges on L is a
  conclusion about L. The PRE-REGISTERED primary is unchanged and is still the
  verdict's quantity; these say how much of it SURVIVES the trend.
    arm        pre-registered    L = 32 windows      L = 16 windows
    DERIVED   +0.3098 +-0.0265  +0.0130 +-0.0125  +0.0038 +-0.0127
    PINNED    VOID
    IID171    +0.0432 +-0.0216  +0.0541 +-0.0203  +0.0450 +-0.0203
    BLK8      +0.7068 +-0.0289  +0.4780 +-0.0318  +0.2528 +-0.0140

  CLAUSE 0 (FIRST) -- LIVENESS AND IDENTIFICATION. An arm with no scored
  window, or an index the genome could not run, is VOID. The primary is
  UNDEFINED at m < 2, so the identification check asks how many DERIVED
  creatures carry m >= 5 -- asserting identification is how a gate that cannot
  fail gets written (`vacuity-gate-cannot-guard-a-rejection`).
    DERIVED  ok    creatures 24/24  windows 10176  ctx_slots 2  present 1.0000
    PINNED   ok    creatures 12/12  windows 5088  ctx_slots 2  present 1.0000
    IID171   ok    creatures 12/12  windows 5088  ctx_slots 2  present 1.0000
    BLK8     ok    creatures 12/12  windows 5088  ctx_slots 2  present 1.0000
    DERIVED  w_obs 0.1668 against §53's 0.1712 (|d| 0.0044, tol 0.03)  PASS
    DERIVED  m >= 5 on 24 of 24 creatures (need 20), degenerate 0  PASS

  CLAUSE 1 -- THE EXACT SELF-TEST. On PINNED the pin IS the label, so no
  window can be mis-assigned: m must be ZERO, not small.
    PINNED   m 0 over 5088 windows, degenerate 0  PASS

  CLAUSE 2 -- THE CALIBRATION, BOTH ENDS OF THE ESTIMATOR'S RANGE. IID171 is
  §54's mode 3 (a coin per trial), so its primary is ZERO by construction and
  its across-creature SD is THE ERROR MODEL -- not the pre-flight arithmetic
  (`power-is-not-the-error-model`). BLK8 draws the same coin once per 8
  consecutive teaching windows, so every error has a neighbour and `obs` must
  read 1.0000 bar one block truncated by the session's end.
    IID171   primary +0.0432 +- 0.0216 (tol +0.0567)   w_obs 0.1663   PASS
