    DERIVED  |exact - shuffle| 0.0070 (tol 0.02)  PASS
    IID171   |exact - shuffle| 0.0068 (tol 0.02)  PASS
    BLK8     |exact - shuffle| 0.0055 (tol 0.02)  PASS
    the formula  checked on 3 of 4 arms (ZERO would be a gate that cannot
